<title>FRANCE: Air Liberte denies bankruptcy filing report.</title>
<headline>Air Liberte denies bankruptcy filing report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>French airline Air Liberte denied a newspaper report on Thursday which raised the possibility of it getting ready to make a bankruptcy filing.</p>
<p>&quot;I am formally denying the bankruptcy filing possibility raised in Le Monde newspaper,&quot; the airline's chairman, Lofti Belhassine, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Le Monde had said: &quot;Air Liberte could file for bankruptcy on September 23.&quot;</p>
